@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Context.puml

title TWS录音系统全场景时序图 - 含实时存储与有限缓存

actor 用户 as User
participant "充电盒" as Case
participant "主耳机" as Primary
participant "从耳机" as Secondary
participant "链路质量监测" as LinkMonitor
participant "缓冲区管理器" as BufferManager
participant "流控管理器" as FlowControl
participant "存储管理器" as StorageManager
participant "充电盒存储" as Storage
participant "录音文件合并器" as Merger

== 场景1: 正常录音 - 实时同步存储(缓存受限) ==

User -> Case: 点击录音键(pressRecordButton())
activate Case
Case -> Case: 检测耳机状态(detectEarbudsStatus())\n返回: L1状态(双耳在盒)
Case -> Case: 选择录音源(selectRecordingSource())\n决策: 使用充电盒MIC
Case -> Case: 初始化录音参数(initRecordingParams())\n48kHz/48kbps → 6KB/s数据速率

Case -> BufferManager: 创建缓冲会话(createBufferSession(session_id="CASE_001", max_size=12KB))
activate BufferManager
BufferManager --> Case: 句柄( buffer_handle, threshold=80% )
note right of BufferManager: 最大缓存: 12KB (约2秒)\n高水位线: 9.6KB (80%)

Case -> StorageManager: 打开存储文件(openStorageFile(filename="REC_001.dat", mode="append"))
activate StorageManager
StorageManager -> Storage: 创建文件句柄(file_open())
activate Storage
Storage --> StorageManager: fd
deactivate Storage
StorageManager --> Case: file_handle

Case -> Case: 启动录音(startAudioCapture())
Case -> FlowControl: 设置流控参数(configFlowControl(bitrate=48kbps, link_capacity=80kbps))
activate FlowControl
FlowControl --> Case: 流控就绪
deactivate FlowControl

note over Case, StorageManager: <b>▶️ 实时同步循环开始 (每50ms一次)</b>

loop 每50ms音频块 (300字节)
    Case -> Case: 捕获音频块(captureAudioBlock(duration=50ms))
    Case -> BufferManager: 写入缓冲(writeBuffer(data_chunk, timestamp, size=300B))
    activate BufferManager
    BufferManager -> BufferManager: 检查缓存水位(checkWaterLevel())
    
    alt 缓存已满或达到阈值 (>9.6KB) - 高频率发生
        BufferManager -> BufferManager: 标记为URGENT_SYNC
        BufferManager --> Case: 状态=NEED_SYNC_URGENT
    else 缓存正常
        BufferManager --> Case: 状态=BUFF_OK
    end
    
    deactivate BufferManager
    
    alt 需要同步 (每200ms或URGENT触发)
        Case -> FlowControl: 请求同步配额(requestSyncQuota(data_size=1200B))
        activate FlowControl
        FlowControl -> LinkMonitor: 查询链路容量(queryLinkCapacity())
        activate LinkMonitor
        LinkMonitor --> FlowControl: capacity=80kbps, current_loss=3%
        deactivate LinkMonitor
        
        alt 链路质量OK (loss < 10%)
            FlowControl --> Case: quota_granted=true, max_batch=1500B
        else 链路拥塞
            FlowControl --> Case: quota_granted=false, wait_ms=50
            Case -> Case: 等待并检查缓存溢出风险
        end
        deactivate FlowControl
        
        alt 配额通过
            Case -> StorageManager: 追加写入(appendWrite(file_handle, data_batch))
            activate StorageManager
            StorageManager -> Storage: 写入磁盘(storage_write(fd, data_batch))
            activate Storage
            Storage --> StorageManager: 写入完成(ACK)
            deactivate Storage
            StorageManager --> Case: 写入确认(bytes_written=1200)
            deactivate StorageManager
            
            Case -> BufferManager: 删除已同步数据(flushSyncedData(size=1200B))
            activate BufferManager
            BufferManager -> BufferManager: 释放已用空间\n剩余缓存: 0KB
            deactivate BufferManager
            
            note right of BufferManager: <font color=green>✓ 数据已安全落盘\n缓存压力释放</font>
        end
    end
end

note over Case, Storage: <b>▶️ 实时同步循环结束</b>

deactivate Case

== 场景2: 主耳录音中 - 含实时同步(缓存压力) ==

User -> Case: 开盒取出双耳
Case -> Primary: 蓝牙命令: 启动录音与同步\n(cmdStartRecordingAndSync(session_id="EAR_002", storage_path="REC_002.dat"))

User -> Case: 点击录音键
Case -> Primary: 开始录音并实时同步(startRecordingWithSync())

activate Primary
Primary -> Primary: 检测为主耳\n启动MIC捕获

Primary -> BufferManager: 创建有限缓冲(createBufferSession(session_id="EAR_002", max_size=8KB))
activate BufferManager
note right of BufferManager: 耳机端缓存更小: 8KB (约1.3秒)\n限制: 耳机RAM资源紧张

Primary -> StorageManager: 通过蓝牙打开远程文件\n(openRemoteStorageFile(path="REC_002.dat"))
StorageManager --> Primary: 远程文件句柄(remote_fd)

note over Primary, StorageManager: <b>▶️ 主耳实时同步循环 (每30ms, 180字节)</b>

loop 录音持续中...
    Primary -> Primary: 捕获音频(captureAudio(duration=30ms))
    Primary -> BufferManager: 写入(writeBuffer(data, timestamp))
    activate BufferManager
    BufferManager -> BufferManager: 检查水位(current_usage)
    
    alt 缓存 > 6.4KB (80%阈值)
        BufferManager --> Primary: WARNING: 缓存压力高
        note right of Primary: <font color=red>⚠️ 缓存即将溢出!\n必须立即同步</font>
    end
    deactivate BufferManager
    
    Primary -> FlowControl: 检查蓝牙带宽(checkBluetoothBandwidth())
    activate FlowControl
    FlowControl -> LinkMonitor: 获取实时链路质量(getRealtimeLinkQuality())
    activate LinkMonitor
    LinkMonitor --> FlowControl: quality=GOOD(loss=4%), rtt=15ms
    deactivate LinkMonitor
    
    alt 链路质量GOOD
        FlowControl --> Primary: capacity_available=60kbps
        deactivate FlowControl
        
        Primary -> StorageManager: 远程追加写入(remoteAppendWrite(remote_fd, data_chunk))
        activate StorageManager
        StorageManager -> Case: 通过蓝牙传输(transmitOverBluetooth(data_chunk))
        activate Case
        
        Case -> Storage: 落盘存储(storage_write(local_fd, data_chunk))
        activate Storage
        Storage --> Case: ACK
        deactivate Storage
        
        Case --> StorageManager: 传输确认
        deactivate Case
        StorageManager --> Primary: sync_confirmed
        deactivate StorageManager
        
        Primary -> BufferManager: flushSyncedData()\n释放已同步的缓存
        note right of BufferManager: <font color=green>✓ 同步成功\n缓存释放</font>
        
    else 链路质量POOR (loss > 15%)
        FlowControl --> Primary: capacity_available=15kbps (不足!)
        deactivate FlowControl
        
        note right of Primary: <font color=red>⚠️ 链路拥塞!\n无法实时同步</font>
        
        alt 缓存未满
            Primary -> BufferManager: 继续缓冲(keepBuffering())\n等待链路恢复
            note right of BufferManager: 数据积压中...\n缓存使用率↑
        else 缓存即将满 (usage > 7KB)
            BufferManager --> Primary: ERROR: 缓存溢出风险
            Primary -> Primary: 质量降级策略(qualityDegradation())\n降低码率: 48kbps → 32kbps → 24kbps
            note right of Primary: 牺牲音质保连续性\n数据生成速率下降
        end
    end
end

deactivate Primary

== 场景3: 链路中断 - 缓存积压与恢复 ==

note over Primary, StorageManager: <b>⚠️ 链路突然中断</b>
LinkMonitor -> Primary: 链路中断告警(linkBroken(loss_rate=85%, timeout))

activate Primary
Primary -> Primary: 标记中断点(markDisconnectPoint(seq_num=8500, timestamp=T_disconnect))
Primary -> BufferManager: 查询剩余缓存(queryRemainingCapacity())
activate BufferManager
BufferManager --> Primary: remaining=1.2KB (约200ms)\n警告: 缓存即将耗尽!
deactivate BufferManager

note over Primary, BufferManager: <font color=red>关键决策: 缓存有限, 无法长期保存\n必须在200ms内恢复链路或停止录音</font>

alt 尝试快速恢复 (100ms内)
    Primary -> LinkMonitor: 启动快速重连(attemptFastReconnect(timeout=100ms))
    
    LinkMonitor --> Primary: 重连成功? (60%概率)
    
    alt 重连成功
        Primary -> StorageManager: 恢复同步(resumeSync())
        note right of Primary: <font color=green>✓ 快速恢复\n盲区<100ms</font>
    else 重连失败
        Primary -> BufferManager: 检查积压数据(checkBacklog())
        activate BufferManager
        BufferManager --> Primary: 积压: 4.8KB (最后800ms数据)
        deactivate BufferManager
        
        note over Primary: 缓存已满且即将溢出!\n必须丢弃旧数据或停止录音
        
        alt 继续录音 (数据丢失模式)
            Primary -> BufferManager: 设置覆盖模式(setOverwriteMode(true))
            note right of BufferManager: 新数据覆盖最旧数据\n<strong>滑动窗口缓存</strong>\n持续时间: 始终保持最后800ms
        else 停止录音保数据
            Primary -> Primary: 停止捕获(stopCapture())
            Primary -> User: 通知录音暂停(notifyUserPaused())
        end
    end
end
deactivate Primary

note over Primary, Case: <b>▶️ 中断期间: 数据仅保存在耳机RAM\n充电盒存储出现数据断层</b>

== 场景4: 主从切换 - 缓存交接与存储同步 ==

note over Primary, Secondary: <b>主耳(左)电量低触发主动切换</b>
Primary -> LinkMonitor: 评估切换(evaluateSwitchNeed())\n电量: 左耳27%, 右耳65%

LinkMonitor --> Primary: 建议切换(switchRecommended)
Primary -> Secondary: 准备切换(prepareSwitch(new_master="RIGHT", session_id="EAR_002"))

activate Secondary
Secondary -> Secondary: 启动预见性缓存(preemptiveCaching(duration=300ms))\n预录300ms音频到本地缓存
Secondary -> BufferManager: 创建二级缓冲(createSecondaryBuffer(max_size=6KB))

Primary -> BufferManager: 查询未同步数据(queryUnsyncedData())
activate BufferManager
BufferManager --> Primary: unsynced_size=2.4KB (最后400ms数据)
deactivate BufferManager

note over Primary: 关键: 必须将这2.4KB数据同步到充电盒\n否则切换后数据丢失

Primary -> FlowControl: 请求紧急同步(requestEmergencySync(size=2.4KB))
activate FlowControl
FlowControl -> LinkMonitor: 查询链路容量
LinkMonitor --> FlowControl: quality=GOOD
FlowControl --> Primary: quota_granted\nmax_latency=50ms
deactivate FlowControl

Primary -> StorageManager: 同步剩余数据(syncRemainingData(data_size=2.4KB))
activate StorageManager
StorageManager -> Case: 传输数据(transmitOverBluetooth())
Case -> Storage: 追加写入(fd, data)
Storage --> Case: ACK\n数据落盘确认
Case --> StorageManager: 传输完成
StorageManager --> Primary: 同步完成确认\n所有数据已安全存储
deactivate StorageManager

note right of Primary: <font color=green>✓ 切换前数据已落盘\n充电盒存储完整</font>

Primary -> BufferManager: 清空本地缓存(clearBuffer())\n本地缓存释放

Primary -> Secondary: 发送切换确认(switchCommit(timestamp=T_switch))
Secondary -> Secondary: 接管为主耳(becomeMaster())
Secondary -> StorageManager: 继续向同一文件追加(continueAppend(session_id="EAR_002", remote_fd))

Secondary -> BufferManager: 合并预见性缓存(mergePreemptiveCache())\n将预录300ms标记为有效数据
note right of BufferManager: 重叠窗口: 最后300ms\n主耳和从耳都有数据\n合并时优先主耳数据

Secondary -> Case: 通知切换完成(notifySwitchComplete(new_master="RIGHT"))
deactivate Secondary

== 场景5: 录音结束 - 基于存储的合并流程 ==

User -> Case: 停止录音(stopRecording())
activate Case
Case -> Primary: 停止(stop())
Case -> Secondary: 停止(stop())

Case -> Merger: 合并请求(initiateMerging(sessions=["EAR_002"]))

activate Merger
Merger -> StorageManager: 从存储读取录音元数据(getRecordingMetadata(file="REC_002.dat"))
activate StorageManager
StorageManager -> Storage: 读取文件头信息(readFileHeader())
Storage --> StorageManager: 元数据(时长、码率、盲区标记)
deactivate Storage

note right of StorageManager: 存储特征:\n1. 连续数据块 (大部分)\n2. 标记点: T_disconnect, T_switch, T_reconnect\n3. 盲区段: seq_gap 12200-13000 (4.9秒)

StorageManager --> Merger: metadata
deactivate StorageManager

Merger -> Storage: 读取音频数据流(readStream())
activate Storage
Storage --> Merger: 数据流 + 标记点(markers[])
deactivate Storage

Merger -> Merger: 根据标记点解析(parseByMarkers())
Merger -> Merger: 盲区检测与插值(detectAndInterpolateBlindGaps())
Merger -> Merger: 多段数据对齐(alignMultiSegments())\n按时间戳排序

note right of Merger: 合并策略:\n1. 优先使用充电盒存储的数据\n2. 耳机缓存仅作为恢复补充\n3. 盲区根据大小智能插值\n4. 重叠窗口加权混合

Merger -> Storage: 写入最终文件(writeFinal("FINAL_REC_002.mp3"))
activate Storage
Storage --> Merger: 最终文件路径
deactivate Storage

Merger --> Case: 合并结果(continuity_index=98.3%, blind_gaps:[{pos:"14:20:15", dur:"4.9s", type:"link_failure"}])
deactivate Merger
deactivate Case

== 关键API与数据流总结 ==

note over User, Storage
    <b>修订后的核心API (增加存储约束):</b>
    
    <font color=blue>▶ 耳机端API (带缓存限制)</font>
    - createBufferSession(session_id, max_size=8KB) → 创建有限缓存
    - writeBuffer() → 写入并检查水位
    - getWaterLevel() → 返回当前使用率(0-100%)
    - flushSyncedData() → 同步成功后释放
    
    <font color=blue>▶ 流控与同步API</font>
    - requestSyncQuota(data_size) → 申请传输配额
    - getRealtimeLinkQuality() → 实时链路质量
    - qualityDegradation() → 链路不足时降码率
    
    <font color=blue>▶ 存储管理API (核心新增)</font>
    - openRemoteStorageFile() → 耳机端打开充电盒文件
    - remoteAppendWrite() → 实时追加写入
    - syncRemainingData() → 切换前强制同步
    
    <font color=red>▶ 关键约束与设计原则</font>
    1. <b>缓存不是无限的</b>: 耳机端8-12KB, 充电盒端12-20KB
    2. <b>数据必须尽快落盘</b>: 高水位(80%)触发强制同步
    3. <b>链路拥塞时降码率</b>: 48k→32k→24kbps, 保证连续性
    4. <b>切换前必须同步</b>: 避免数据丢失在耳机RAM
    5. <b>最终合并基于存储</b>: 不依赖易失性缓存
    
    <font color=purple>▶ 盲窗产生根本原因</font>
    1. 链路中断 + 缓存有限(200ms) → 数据丢失
    2. 同步未完成 + 切换 → 数据在RAM丢失
    3. 存储I/O延迟 → 小盲区(20-50ms)
    
    <font color=green>▶ 优化方向</font>
    - 增加耳机RAM缓存至20KB (成本↑)
    - 采用压缩算法减少数据量 (功耗↑)
    - 蓝牙5.2+LE Audio提升带宽 (硬件↑)
    - 预测性同步避免积压 (算法复杂度↑)
end note

@enduml